{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [G],        Kya karein kya na karein
[F] [Am],        Ye kaisi mushkil hay
[C] [G],        Koi to bata de iska
[F] [Am],        Hal o mere bhai
[Am] [G],        Ki ek taraf to ussay Pyar kare hum
[F] [G],        Aur usko hi ye kehne Se darrein hum
[C] [G],        Roz roz hum
[Am] [G],        sochta yehi
[C] [G],        Aaj humko vo agar
[D] [Am],        mil jaaye kahin
[C] [G],        To aisa bolega
[Am] [G],        saala vaisa bolega
[C] [G],        Khullam khulla uspe Dil ka
[D] [C],        raaz hum kholega
[Am],        Vo saamne chamakti hai
[G],        Saans hi atakti hai
[F] [G],        Aur ye zubaan jaati hai fisal
[Am] [G],        To Kya karein kya na kare...
[C],        Koi badi baat nahin
[Am],        Humein kehna tha jo bhi
[Am] [G] [F] [Am],        Vo to hum yoonhi kehte magar
[C],        Phir bhi kaha nahin
[Am],        vajah iski hai yehi
[Am] [G] [F] [Am],        Bas inkaar se humko tha darr
[Am],        Ab kahein ya na kahein
[G],        Ki haan kahein na kahein
[F] [G],        Soch soch mein hi vo gayi nikal
[Am] [G],        To Kya karein kya na kare...
